      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Aubin et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Propionibacterium acnes is now well-known and recognized for its implication in the pathogenesis of acne vulgaris. Here, we report the draft genome sequence of an erythromycin-resistant P. acnes strain isolated from a case of folliculitis of the scalp belonging to phylotype IA1 and sequence type 18 (ST18)."
      },
